From 8372c97ad93b3a9123b8dd2ddb7d103fcd7f95dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "M.K. Muere" <mkgr.muere@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:14:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Link the scaffold, new favicon, self-hosted fonts, motion
 toggle

- First portfolio card ("The Soft Launch") links to scaffold.html; the whole
  card is clickable, with a focus ring on the card
- New butterfly/moth favicon (SVG day + night, ICO and apple-touch fallbacks);
  the tab icon follows the site theme
- Self-host Latin-subset WOFF2 fonts (~62 KB total) instead of Google Fonts;
  preload Manrope + Space Mono, and Pirata One at night (fixes a 0.03 CLS)
- "pause motion" toggle in the footer (WCAG 2.2.2); OS reduce-motion is the
  default until a visitor chooses; the canvas loop is cancelled when paused
- Accessibility: 12px minimum for small labels, 44px menu button, pointer
  cursor only on real links, glitch copies hidden when motion is off
- Mobile: the wandering butterfly sits behind text on touch screens

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KFULVLZW95nvQw2tSvWvkh
